# 🎓 Naija Study Hub - Complete Platform Build

**Everything you need to transform your study platform into a full-featured learning ecosystem.**

This package contains 4 production-ready components:

---

## 📦 What's Included

### 1. 📚 **Interactive Quiz System** (`quiz-system.html`)
- Multiple-choice quizzes with 5-10 questions each
- Instant feedback with explanations
- Automatic score calculation and storage
- Quiz completion tracking
- Retake functionality
- Pre-loaded with 3 sample quizzes (Basic Science, Math, English)

**Features:**
- ✅ Responsive design (mobile-friendly)
- ✅ Progress bar for each quiz
- ✅ No backend needed (uses browser storage)
- ✅ 3 difficulty levels pre-configured
- ✅ Easy to add more quizzes

**Usage:** File is ready to use immediately. Just upload to your server.

---

### 2. 👤 **Student Dashboard** (`student-dashboard.html`)
- User login/registration system
- Progress tracking (auto-syncs with quizzes)
- Subject-wise performance breakdown
- Achievements and badges system
- Study streak counter (consecutive days)
- Personalized learning recommendations
- Calendar showing study activity
- Average score calculation

**Features:**
- ✅ Zero backend setup needed
- ✅ Beautiful UI with animations
- ✅ Fully responsive
- ✅ Local data storage
- ✅ Auto-updates when quizzes are taken

**Usage:** Students click dashboard → login → see their progress automatically.

---

### 3. 💳 **Premium Store** (`premium-store.html`)
- Professional product catalog
- 10+ sample study packs pre-configured
- Shopping cart and checkout flow
- Payment method selection (Paystack/Flutterwave)
- Order management
- Email/phone customer collection
- Product filtering by subject, level, price
- Order history tracking

**Pre-loaded Products:**
- WAEC/JAMB prep bundles (₦2,000-3,500)
- Subject-specific packs (₦1,000-2,000)
- School/bulk licenses (₦15,000+)

**Features:**
- ✅ Ready for Paystack integration
- ✅ Ready for Flutterwave integration
- ✅ Can accept bank transfers
- ✅ Beautiful product cards
- ✅ Easy to add/edit products

**Usage:** Upload file, customize products, integrate payment provider (see guide).

---

### 4. 📖 **Implementation Guide** (`IMPLEMENTATION_GUIDE.md`)
- Step-by-step deployment instructions
- GitHub Pages setup guide
- Payment integration tutorials
- Adding more quiz content
- Troubleshooting common issues
- Performance checklist
- 4-week launch timeline
- Key metrics to track

**What it covers:**
- ✅ How to deploy each component
- ✅ How to add payment processing
- ✅ How to customize for your platform
- ✅ How to track success metrics
- ✅ What to do next

